From: Demo Solution Team <noreply@example.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] cm: retain shared storage while another instance version survives

Instance records are versioned but service storage is not. Retire obsolete
records without deleting data owned by active, cached, disabled or scheduled
versions of the same full InstanceIdent. Delete storage for the final owner.
Keep failed retirements visible to subsequent ownership checks and retries.
No Cloud protocol, database schema, storage layout, quota or TTL change.

Upstream-Status: Pending [platform-confirmed defect; local regression proof]
Base: aos_core_lib_cpp 60cb83535f773762c61ac5f544b31b7b88c502e3

